Despawn Tweaks (Itamio port for Minecraft 26.3)

This mod is an unofficial port of "Despawn Tweaks" by txnimc
(https://github.com/txnimc/DespawnTweaks, LGPL-3.0-only, 3.9M
downloads on Modrinth, max Minecraft 1.21.1).

All credit for the original concept, design, and logic goes to
txnimc. This port was created by Itamio to bring the mod to
Minecraft 26.3 (Fabric) because the original has not been updated
to this version.

Itamio does not take credit for any of the original assets or logic.
The code was updated to be compatible with Minecraft 26.3 (Fabric).
Port changes: the structure/spawner tracking system and its config
API dependency are not ported; the core despawn protection for
mobs that picked up items is preserved.
